      { k: "n8n workflow automation", v: "PDF/DOCX ingestion pipeline, YouTube capture pipeline, newsletter routing." },
      { k: "Deterministic retrieval", v: "a custom retrieval index (pka_retrieve.py) with an OKF frontmatter spec, built for auditable recall over ad-hoc similarity search." },
      { k: "Anthropic Claude API / SDK", v: "direct API usage underlying all of the above." },
